{% doc %}
  Outputs 'true' when this product's PRICE already includes the $5 Alberta tire
  levy, else 'false'. The droplet prices every Trail Tire product as
  (cost + $5 levy) x markup, so adding the tire recycling fee on top would bill
  the levy twice. Own stock and ATW (priced at ATW's list) do not include it.

  Used by the product page's installed total and by every button that opens
  the booking modal (data-levy-in-price). Add North Country Tire's tag to the
  list when its tires are published.
  Mirrored server-side in princetires-app src/lib/shopify/product-tier.ts
  (LEVY_IN_PRICE_TAGS) — KEEP IN SYNC.

  @param {object} product - The Shopify product object

  @example
    {%- capture levy_in_price -%}{% render 'pt-levy-in-price', product: product %}{%- endcapture -%}
{% enddoc %}
{%- liquid
  assign levy_tags = 'trail-tire-supply' | split: ','
  assign levy_in = 'false'
  for t in product.tags
    assign t_lower = t | strip | downcase
    if levy_tags contains t_lower
      assign levy_in = 'true'
    endif
  endfor
-%}{{- levy_in -}}
